[b]Factions is now part of [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3737705389]Flavorium Universalis[/url]. You can unsubscribe from this item.[/b]

From Flavorium Universalis 0.4 the political parties are built into the main mod, on a Factions tab of the Court Ledger, and switched on or off with the game rule "C&C: Political Parties" (on by default).

This item is now empty, so keeping it subscribed does nothing. Saves that used it carry on as before.
